{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/01_Hero_eng.png?t=1745450597\" />Most of your kin are endowed with inhuman beauty and charm. You drew the short straw, losing your human form. With your new appearance, you are an outcast among humans and your kind. But the skills you acquired while still alive ensure your dignified existence in society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/02_slide.png?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/03_Story_eng.png?t=1745450597\" />But suddenly you receive a message that sets in motion a series of strange, confusing events involving a confrontation between two vampire clans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding yourself between two fires, it's up to you to sort through the chaos, choose a side or stay true to yourself, and most importantly, survive in this <strong>Hungry Town!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/02_slide.png?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/04_usp_eng.png?t=1745450597\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini-games and riddles hidden in the locations.</strong> Infiltrate forbidden areas, hack security systems, show methods of deduction and look for hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blood management system and invisible karma scale of the main character.</strong> Restrain your hunger and realize yourself, who you are - a bad guy or a do-gooder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An exciting story in the style of a detective thriller.</strong> Immerse yourself in the author's story of confrontation, where you will have to be not only a nocturnal predator, but also the one who gets away with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your own smartphone.</strong> It's your indispensable assistant: make calls, take photos, use the map, receive emails and take notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Juicy graphics and immersive music accompaniment.</strong> All these elements convey the mysterious atmosphere of the world of modern gothic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your choice affects the plot.</strong> Passing the game, you will have to make decisions, the consequences of which can lead to unexpected turns of events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/02_slide.png?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/04_screen.gif?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/Conversation.gif?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/Mini_game_phone.gif?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/02_slide.png?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/05_Wishlist_eng.png?t=1745450597\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2481160?t=1745450597","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745450597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/67b4d618bd58bf55b54fbebc9d4ff39752a8dc70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=