dden areas, hack security systems, show methods of deduction and look for hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blood management system and invisible karma scale of the main character.</strong> Restrain your hunger and realize yourself, who you are - a bad guy or a do-gooder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An exciting story in the style of a detective thriller.</strong> Immerse yourself in the author's story of confrontation, where you will have to be not only a nocturnal predator, but also the one who gets away with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your own smartphone.</strong> It's your indispensable assistant: make calls, take photos, use the map, receive emails and take notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Juicy graphics and immersive music accompaniment.</strong> All these elements convey the mysterious atmosphere of the world of modern gothic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your choice affects the plot.</strong> Passing the game, you will have to make decisions, the consequences of which can lead to unexpected turns of events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/02_slide.png?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/04_screen.gif?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/Conversation.gif?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/Mini_game_phone.gif?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/02_slide.png?t=1745450597\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481160/extras/05_Wi